ion Options","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon: choose a future workout or game","notes":"Walk through approved student areas, locate the fitness and intramural facilities, and ask staff which spaces require reservations or orientation.","short_summary":"Use one visit to understand where indoor fitness, swimming, bowling, and court activities happen.","evidence_claim":"The Physical Learning Center houses student recreation facilities including pools, an intramural room and track, fitness center, bowling alley, and racquetball courts.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Experience-the-Grove/Facilities/Physical-Learning-Center","source_title":"Physical Learning Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The facility page does not publish general weekend hours; students should verify access, eligibility, and equipment rules before participating.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gcc-pew-fine-arts-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"J. Howard Pew Fine Arts Center","title":"See Where Campus Performances Happen","subtitle":"Saturday before noon: map the College's arts venues","notes":"Arrive during public Saturday hours, locate Ketler Auditorium and the recital spaces, and check official listings before planning a performance.","short_summary":"A daytime walkthrough introduces the main music and theater facility without assuming an event is scheduled.","evidence_claim":"Pew Fine Arts Center includes Ketler Auditorium, a black-box theater, recital and rehearsal halls, practice rooms, and music and theater facilities.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Experience-the-Grove/Facilities/Pew-Fine-Arts-Center","source_title":"Pew Fine Arts Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_