s","source_title":"Ministry Facilities","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The prayer room is published as open daily from 6:30 a.m. to midnight for members of the campus community.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gcc-intramural-sports","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Grove City College Intramural Sports","title":"Pick One Activity for the Weeks Ahead","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon: turn the weekend into a next step","notes":"Review the listed sports, choose one that fits your experience level, and contact Student Recreation for registration and schedule details.","short_summary":"Close the weekend by identifying a recurring activity that can connect recreation with campus life.","evidence_claim":"Grove City College offers intramural activities across multiple skill levels, including team sports, racquet sports, bowling, table games, and esports.","source_url":"https://www.gcc.edu/Home/Experience-the-Grove/Organizations-Clubs/Club-Sports-Athletic-Organizations","source_title":"Club Sports & Athletic Organizations","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation schedules, registration deadlines, locations, and eligibility vary; contact Student Recreation before attending or joining.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
